    "body": "@domenic I have put together a draft PR for an extension to the COOP spec. Could you have a look and let me know what you think?\r\n\r\nBasically, as explained in this [explainer](https://github.com/camillelamy/explainers/blob/master/coi-with-popups.md), we would liked to have COOP same-origin-allow-popups + COEP allow pages to be crossOriginIsolated. This requires that we put same-origin documents with different crossOriginIsolated status in separate processes. To achieve that, we need to at least change the agent cluster scoping, which I am doing in the PR. I think Anne also mentioned something about IsPlatformObjectSameOrigin, but I am not sure where it is nor what needs to be changed.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\nCamille",
